[00:13.01]Growing up is getting old
[00:13.01]成长就是变老啊
[00:17.93]I can't fit my favorite clothes
[00:17.93]穿不上我最爱的衣服了
[00:23.03]I stay up and think too much
[00:23.03]熬太多夜，操太多心
[00:27.81]So I get stoned and I get drunk
[00:27.81]所以喝到醉喝到麻木
[00:33.04]I still make the same mistakes
[00:33.04]我仍会犯同样的错
[00:37.92]Like I did at Jackson Lake
[00:37.92]就像我在杰克森湖所做的（位于美怀俄明州）
[00:42.61]Well, I made some friends and let some go
[00:42.61]um,我交了些朋友且疏远了一些
[00:48.00]Growing up is getting old
[00:48.00]成长就是变老啊
[00:53.02]Time goes by, I don't understand it
[00:53.02]时间荏苒，我却并未理解
[00:58.02]Tell me why life starts to lose its magic
[00:58.02]告诉我为什么生活开始失去它的魔力了
[01:03.75]But I still feel it when I look into your eyes
[01:03.75]但在我看到你的眼睛后却又感受到了
[01:20.04]My parents won't be here for long
[01:20.04]我的父母不会在世太久了
[01:24.91]Should see 'em more before they're gone
[01:24.91]也许该在他们走之前多看看他们
[01:29.65]Oh, it hits me when the wrinkles show
[01:29.65]oh,当他们长了皱纹我才突然意识到
[01:35.18]Growing up is getting old
[01:35.18]成长就是变老
[01:40.17]Time goes by, I don't understand it
[01:40.17]时光荏苒，我却并未理解
[01:45.19]Tell me why life starts to lose its magic
[01:45.19]告诉我为什么生活开始失去它的魔力了
[01:50.95]But I still feel it when I look into your eyes
[01:50.95]但当我看着你的眼睛我又再次感受到了
[02:00.28]There's a silver lining in your eyes
[02:00.28]你的眼中仍有点点希望
